      <p begin="00:30.820" end="00:32.320" ttm:agent="v1">My heart skips a beat</p>
      <p begin="00:32.270" end="00:34.160" ttm:agent="v1">When you walk in the room</p>
      <p begin="00:34.160" end="00:35.940" ttm:agent="v1">I go boom, boom, boom</p>
      <p begin="00:35.940" end="00:37.560" ttm:agent="v1">You go zoom, zoom, zoom</p>
      <p begin="00:37.560" end="00:41.010" ttm:agent="v1">You're my playboy, play toy, lover, my friend</p>
      <p begin="00:41.010" end="00:44.560" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna be with you until the end</p>
      <p begin="00:44.560" end="00:48.180" ttm:agent="v1">I'd give my heart and my soul to you</p>
      <p begin="00:48.180" end="00:51.560" ttm:agent="v1">To make you see it's true</p>
      <p begin="00:51.560" end="00:55.150" ttm:agent="v1">I'm so confused, baby, can't you see</p>
